	'bk_t' => 'Book a readiness review',
	'book_0_h' => 'Tell us about the floor',
	'book_0_p1' => 'A readiness review is booked before an office move, a furniture purchase, or a return to the office. Tell us how many desks are in, where the floor is, and why now. Teams we usually see are five to sixty people, and the person who writes is often an office or operations manager, or an HR or facilities lead. If you already know the shape of the fee, it is still worth writing: a small team up to ten desks is €1,450, a floor of eleven to thirty desks is €2,900, a single desk on site is €220, and a remote desk review is €140. Prices exclude VAT. The scoping call that comes before any of those is free.',
	'book_1_h' => 'Before you write',
	'book_1_n' => 'BEFORE YOU WRITE',
	'book_1_p1' => 'Three things make the reply useful. How many desks, and whether they are in one room or split between an office and home. Where the floor is, so we can say whether the visit sits inside 40 km of Northvale or whether travel beyond that, at €0.45 per kilometre, belongs on the invoice. Why now: an office move, a furniture purchase, a return to the office, or another reason you can describe in a sentence. Add the weeks you would prefer. Visit days are Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday, and they fill about three weeks ahead. If none of the open weeks suit, the Next openings list is the place to hear when a month opens. You do not need a floor plan to write. You will need one before the visit day.',
	'book_2_h' => 'Write to us',
	'book_2_p1' => 'Use the form on this page to send the request. If the form is not available, write to Katachi at hello@katachi-ergonomics.example. The message should say how many desks, where, and why now. We reply within two working days and offer a scoping call. The call is thirty minutes, by phone or video, and it is free. On it we agree the desks, the date and what readiness means for you. Nothing is booked as a visit until that conversation has happened. The phone line is 010 736 2240, open Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 16:00. Office hours at the studio are Monday to Friday, 08:30 to 17:30.',
	'book_3_h' => 'Where we are',
	'book_3_p1' => 'Katachi Ergonomics is at Unit 4, 18 Foundry Row, Northvale. The studio is where the plans are written, not where the review happens. Visit days are at your site, Tuesday, Wednesday or Thursday, 08:30 to 17:00. Friday is for reports only. Saturday, Sunday and public holidays are closed. On-site work runs within 40 km of Northvale, with travel included. Remote desk reviews run anywhere, forty minutes by video, for one person at a time. If you are writing for a floor larger than thirty desks, say so: additional desks on the same day are €85 each, and a floor of eleven to thirty is staffed by two consultants.',
	'book_l' => 'BOOK',
