	'fees_1_h' => 'What every review includes',
	'fees_1_p1' => 'A readiness review, whether for a small team or for a floor, includes four things: the scoping call, the visit day, the written plan and the six-week check. The call is the free thirty minutes in which we agree the desks, the date and what readiness means. The visit day is 08:30 to 17:00 on a Tuesday, Wednesday or Thursday at your site. The plan is one page per desk plus a floor summary, delivered within five working days. The check is ninety minutes on site, six weeks later. A single-desk assessment and a remote desk review include the time stated and a written note; they are not the full floor review. An adjustment session is optional, and only after a review, for fitting chairs, screens and keyboards you already have or have since bought.',
	'fees_2_h' => 'Travel, cancellation and invoicing',
	'fees_2_p1' => 'Travel within 40 km of Northvale is included. Beyond that distance, travel is €0.45 per kilometre. Cancellation is free up to five working days before the visit day. Later than that, the cancellation fee is 25 percent of the fee. We invoice after the plan is delivered, and payment is due in thirty days. Prices exclude VAT. The scoping call is not invoiced. If a visit is rearranged inside the five working days, treat that as a cancellation of the original day and ask for a new date; we would rather say so plainly than hold a day we cannot use. Remote reviews have no travel line. Additional desks beyond thirty are charged at €85 each and only when they are seen on the same day as the floor review.',
	'fees_3_h' => 'What the plan looks like',
