	'inc01_n' => '01 / 03',
	'inc01_p' => 'We look at the chair and the seat, the desk height, the screen and the keyboard, and at how a laptop is set up. The aim is a fit for the person who works there, using what you already have before anything is bought.',
	'inc01_s' => 'Chair, desk, screen, keyboard and laptop.',
