	'inc02_n' => '02 / 03',
	'inc02_p' => 'We check light and glare where the person sits, including the light from a bright window onto the screen. Then we look at noise and layout: where desks face, how routes cross the floor, and whether the room supports the work.',
	'inc02_s' => 'Glare, sound and the way the room is used.',
	'inc02_t' => 'Light, noise and layout',
	'inc03_n' => '03 / 03',
	'inc03_p' => 'Standing and sitting are watched across the day, not set once and left. We look at how long people stand, when they sit, and how breaks and movement fit the work, including the routes they walk between desks.',
	'inc03_s' => 'Standing, sitting, breaks and routes.',
