	'review_cta_t' => 'The scoping call is free.',
	'review_l' => 'THE REVIEW',
	'review_ld' => 'A readiness review is the look we take before an office move, a furniture purchase, or a return to the office.',
	'review_rest' => 'We watch the desks that are already in use, then we write down only the changes that follow from that.',
	'review_t' => 'The Review',
	'search_label' => 'Search',
	'search_results' => 'Search results for: %s',
	'terms_0_h' => 'Booking',
	'terms_0_p1' => 'A booking starts when you write and we offer a scoping call. The call is thirty minutes, by phone or video, and it is free. On the call we agree the desks, the date and what readiness means for you. The visit itself is a later day, Tuesday, Wednesday or Thursday, 08:30 to 17:00 at your site, within 40 km of Northvale unless a further travel charge has been agreed. Fees are the seven on the fees page: the free call; €1,450 for up to ten desks; €2,900 for eleven to thirty desks with two consultants; €220 for a single desk on site; €480 for a half-day adjustment session; €140 for a remote desk review; €85 per additional desk beyond thirty on the same day. We reply to enquiries within two working days.',
	'terms_1_h' => 'Cancellation',
	'terms_1_p1' => 'Cancellation is free up to five working days before the visit day. Later than that, the cancellation fee is 25 percent of the fee. Rearranging inside those five working days is treated as a cancellation of the original day, and a new date is agreed if we have one. The scoping call can be moved without a fee. The six-week check is part of the readiness review; if you cancel the check, say so and we will close the file without treating the check as a separate booking. Adjustment sessions, once booked, follow the same five-working-day rule. Remote reviews follow it as well, counted back from the video appointment rather than from a visit day.',
	'terms_2_h' => 'Liability',
	'terms_2_p1' => 'The review is advice about the desk, the room and the working day. It is not medical treatment, and it is not a diagnosis. Where a person needs a diagnosis, we refer to a physiotherapist or a doctor. We do not promise that pain, fatigue or concentration will change. Field notes report what people told us at a six-week check on a named kind of floor, with the company name withheld. They are not a forecast. We do not sell furniture and we do not take a commission on what you buy. A purchase list, when one is attached, names a gap. Choosing and buying remain yours. The written plan is for your team. It is not a certificate, and it is not for publication.',
	'terms_3_h' => 'Payment',
	'terms_3_p1' => 'We invoice after the plan is delivered. Payment is due in thirty days. Prices exclude VAT. Travel within 40 km of Northvale is included. Beyond that, travel is €0.45 per kilometre, agreed before the visit day. The scoping call is not invoiced. A single-desk assessment and a remote desk review are invoiced after the written note is delivered, on the same thirty-day terms. An adjustment session is invoiced after the half day. If a cancellation fee applies, that fee is invoiced when the cancellation is confirmed. The studio for correspondence is Unit 4, 18 Foundry Row, Northvale, and the address for the invoice is the one you give on the scoping call.',
	'terms_l' => 'TERMS',
	'terms_ld' => 'These terms cover booking a readiness review, cancellation, what the advice is and is not, and how payment works. Prices exclude VAT.',
	'terms_t' => 'Terms',
	'thanks_0_h' => 'Check your email app',
	'thanks_0_p1' => 'If you joined the Next openings list from a page without the list form in place, your email app should be open with a message ready. Send it to hello@katachi-ergonomics.example. You are not on the list until that message is sent. The subject is Join the Next openings list. The note itself arrives on the first Monday of each month and takes about three minutes to read: the open visit days, and one desk tip. If you were writing about a readiness review instead, the same pattern applies. The email app holds a message with the subject Readiness review enquiry. Send it, and we reply within two working days with an offer of the free scoping call.',
	'thanks_1_h' => 'Back to the work',
	'thanks_1_p1' => 'The home page is the long account of the review: what it includes, how a visit day runs, what it costs, and the three field notes. Field notes tell the three visits we are willing to describe in public, with company names withheld: a twenty-four-desk customer-service floor, a twelve-desk architecture studio, and a hybrid team of eight. They are records of what people said, not a promise for your floor. If a date is the thing you need, the Next openings list is the monthly hearing. If a floor is the thing you need seen, the book page is the place to say how many desks, where, and why now.',
	'thanks_home' => 'Back to the home page',
	'thanks_l' => 'THANKS',
	'thanks_ld' => 'Thank you. Check your email app. The message is prepared there, and it still has to be sent.',
	'thanks_notes' => 'Read the journal',
	'thanks_t' => 'Thanks',
